flowchart LR
    subgraph Private["Private authoring boundary"]
        Restricted["Restricted metadata and deliverables"]
        Candidate["Candidate public source"]
    end

    Select["Allowlisted public snapshot"]

    subgraph Gate["Fail-closed publication gate"]
        Metadata["PII, path and binary checks"]
        Evidence["Public source and claim checks"]
        Runtime["CSP, dependency and unit checks"]
        Automation["Workflow and release checks"]
    end

    Fresh["Fresh Git object database\nproject-only commit identity"]
    Host["Public Git host"]
    Pages["Pages: app/ only"]
    Release["Source archive + checksum"]

    Candidate --> Select
    Restricted -. "never selected" .-> Select
    Select --> Metadata
    Select --> Evidence
    Select --> Runtime
    Select --> Automation
    Metadata --> Fresh
    Evidence --> Fresh
    Runtime --> Fresh
    Automation --> Fresh
    Fresh --> Host
    Host --> Pages
    Host --> Release
